Mix components thoroughly, adjust pH to 8.0 with HCl and autoclave.  <br>
Comment:  Artificial sea water (such as artificial sea water in Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=1118">1118</a>) can be used instead of natural sea water.       <br>
